    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "タイシンちゃん、週末のお昼に\r\n食べたいものはありますか～？",
            "enText": "Taishin, is there anything you'd like to eat\nfor lunch this weekend?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 2330377427977520708,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "は？　……急に何の話？",
            "enText": "Huh? What are you talking about?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -7892597472165989622,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "せっかく同室になったんですし、\r\nお料理を振舞いたくて♪\n何か希望はありますか～？",
            "enText": "Now that we're roommates, I wanted to\ncook us a meal to celebrate♪ What would\nyou like?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3998238965014928948,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "……そういう気遣い、いらないから。\r\nアタシはアタシで食べるし。",
            "enText": "…You don't need to do that.\nI eat my meals alone.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4884584802741293709,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "あら、まあ……そうですか……？\r\nそう、ですか……。",
            "enText": "Oh my, is… is that so? I… see.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7207150108836124217,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "え、ちょ――",
            "enText": "Huh? Wait ——",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 5318293332053101380,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "あれもこれも食べてもらいたいなぁって、\r\nメニュー、色々考えちゃってたんですが……。",
            "enText": "There's just so many foods I'd like you to try.\nI put quite a lot of thought into the menu…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5531200926112206317,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "すみません、先走り過ぎましたね。\r\n迷惑だったかしら……。",
            "enText": "But I see now that I was getting ahead\nof myself. I apologize…",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -268548081918440724,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "………はぁー。",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 3755276034845586042,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタタイシン",
            "enName": "Narita Taishin",
            "jpText": "……食べたいものとかは、特にない。\r\nアンタが作ろうと思ってたので、いいから。",
            "enText": "I… don't have any preferences.\nI'll eat whatever you came up with,\nso just make that.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -2454174684589791459,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "スーパークリーク",
            "enName": "Super Creek",
            "jpText": "タイシンちゃん……！　はいっ♪\r\nうふふ、腕によりをかけちゃいますね～！",
            "enText": "Taishin! All right♪ Hehe… I'll make this\nthe best lunch you've ever had!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -7588527695132473521,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780174886,
    "humanTl": true
}